  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.19 Examination Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Real Estate Appraisers Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.19 Examination Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Real Estate Appraisers Board. The examination fees for the professions regulated by the real estate appraisers board under RSA 310-B shall be as follows:\n\n(a) For a licensed residential appraiser, $90;\n\n(b) For a certified residential appraiser, $90; and\n\n(c) For a certified general appraiser, $90.\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35 (formerly Plc 1004.17)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
